  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily and Leo are in the lunch room. They are very hungry. A big board is on the wall. It says: \"School Lunch.\" Lily reads the menu for the week. \"Monday: rice and egg.\" \"I like eggs,\" says Leo. \"Me too,\" says Lily. She likes rice and eggs.",
      "\"Tuesday: chicken and rice.\" \"Chicken is my favorite food!\" says Lily. \"Wednesday: fish and potato.\" Leo makes a funny face. He looks at the board again. \"I do not like fish,\" he says. \"Try it,\" says Lily. \"Fish is good with a potato.\" \"Yes, I try,\" says Leo.",
      "\"Thursday: meatballs and rice.\" \"Friday: sausage and tomato.\" \"Yes! Sausage!\" says Leo. He likes sausage a lot. The board has five days of food. \"Is there fruit?\" asks Leo. \"Yes, there is fruit on the table,\" says Lily. \"What is your favorite day?\" asks Lily. \"Friday!\" says Leo. \"Mine is Thursday,\" says Lily. She likes meatballs and rice. The two friends smile."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily and Leo read the school lunch menu on a board. They talk about the food for Monday to Friday and choose a favorite day.",
